        "title": "Warm-up: interact",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Attend to the other turn, pause and respond to its meaning. If a word is missing, pause or use a visible request-for-help gesture. The spoken repetition-request chunk comes later.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我",
                "pinyin": "wǒ",
                "meaning": "I; me",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "364fba3bd2447ba14bf6e73be5f61e90209a109abbfe24e2f287e738f69f1113"
              },
              {
                "text": "你",
                "pinyin": "nǐ",
                "meaning": "you",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "b316ac0dd167bd8bef2048818a93b55be5371efb0af3024556cf9b5c93799d4d"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A partner points to themself, then points to you and waits. Identify yourself in your turn. The partner has not made any further request; pause or gesture if you need help.\nFamiliar meanings available: I; me; you."
          }
        ]
      },
